## Linguist Configuration for GitHub Language Stats

# Rust contracts
*.rs linguist-language=Rust

# TypeScript/JavaScript
*.ts linguist-language=TypeScript
*.tsx linguist-language=TypeScript
*.js linguist-language=JavaScript

# Exclude dependencies and generated files
node_modules/** linguist-vendored
target/** linguist-vendored
dist/** linguist-generated
build/** linguist-generated
.next/** linguist-generated
coverage/** linguist-generated

# Exclude lock files
package-lock.json linguist-vendored
Cargo.lock linguist-vendored

# Exclude build artifacts
*.wasm linguist-generated

# Exclude environment configs
.env* linguist-vendored

# Mark documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
